== (a) substitution form AT_n = C3[1, TT_(n-2), 1], n = 3..20
  I = {2..n-1} is a transitive module and the quotient on {1, I, n} is 1 -> I -> n -> 1: verified for n = 3..20
== (b) induced subtournaments of AT_n are AT_k (if they contain 1 and n) or TT_k, all subsets, n = 3..12
  verified for every subset at n = 3..12; AT_k and TT_k are self-converse via i -> k+1-i (k <= 16)
