  Fermat primes & Ogg primes = [3, 5, 17]; primes <= 31 all supersingular: True
  3, 5 in the Fi22 layer: True; 17 in B but not Fi22: True
  Schlafli pairs with 1/p + 1/q > 1/2: [(3, 3), (3, 4), (3, 5), (4, 3), (5, 3)]; face sizes [3, 4, 5]
